urnos, idade, último passo e, se interrompido, causa, draft parcial, reset e tempo restante\"},\npose-mcp/internal/cli/help_catalog.go-361-\t\t\t{\"watch\", \"pose delegate watch [<run>|<label>] [-v] [--lines <n>] [--no-follow] [--refresh <d>] [--json]\", \"Follow a run live until it ends, replaying the runs its attempt recorded; with no run, the only running one or a picker\", \"Acompanha um run ao vivo até terminar, reproduzindo os runs que a tentativa registrou; sem run, o único em andamento ou um seletor\"},\npose-mcp/internal/cli/help_catalog.go-362-\t\t\t{\"wait\", \"pose delegate wait <run> [--timeout <d>] [--json]\", \"Block until a run ends; exit 0 approved, 10 changes requested or rejected, 20 failed, 30 interrupted, 40 stalled, 50 timed out\", \"Bloqueia até um run terminar; sai com 0 aprovado, 10 mudanças pedidas ou rejeitado, 20 falhou, 30 interrompido, 40 travado, 50 tempo esgotado\"},\npose-mcp/internal/cli/help_catalog.go-363-\t\t\t{\"resume\", \"pose delegate resume <run> [--wait-until-reset[=<max>]] [--prompt <file|->] [--detach] [--dry-run] [--json]\", \"Continue an interrupted run with the same agent and session, under its original attempt; repeating it returns the recorded continuation\", \"Retoma um run interrompido com o mesmo agente e sessão, sob a tentativa original; repetir devolve a continuação registrada\"},\npose-mcp/internal/cli/help_catalog.go-364-\t\t\t{\"handoff\", \"pose delegate handoff <run> --to <agent|auto> [--detach] [--dry-run] [--json]\", \"Continue a stopped run with another agent under the same attempt and budget, its brief carrying the stopped run's quoted partial and commands\", \"Continua um run parado com outro agente na mesma tentativa e orçamento, com o brief levando o parcial citado e os comandos do run parado\"},\npose-mcp/internal/cli/help_catalog.go:365:\t\t\t{\"cancel\", \"pose delegate cancel <run> [--confirm-abandoned] [--dry-run] [--json]\", \"Stop a running run; it is recorded failed with the cause cancelled and its attempt stays consumed. A stalled attempt whose dispatch ended before recording its run is released with a failed run and its receipt; one an earlier engine left without a marker needs --confirm-abandoned\", \"Para um run em andamento; ele é registrado como failed com a causa cancelled e a tentativa continua consumida. Uma tentativa parada cujo envio terminou antes de registrar o run é liberada com um run com falha e o recibo; uma que um motor anterior deixou sem marcador exige --confirm-abandoned\"},\npose-mcp/internal/cli/help_catalog.go-366-\t\t\t{\"agents\", \"pose delegate agents [--agent <name>] [--access <level>] [--label <name>] [--lead <vendor>[/<model>]] [--json]\", \"List configured agents with vendor, model, whether their CLI is on the path, their last usage-limit reset and their state: available, limited until <instant>, missing or probe-failed\", \"Lista os agentes configurados com vendor, modelo, se a CLI está no path, o último reset de limite de uso e o estado: available, limited until <instante>, missing ou probe-failed\"},\npose-mcp/internal/cli/help_catalog.go-367-\t\t},\npose-mcp/internal/cli/help_catalog.go-368-\t\tExamples: []string{\npose-mcp/internal/cli/help_catalog.go-369-\t\t\t\"pose delegate review spec:my-feature --label my-feature-r1\",\npose-mcp/internal/cli/help_catalog.go-370-\t\t\t\"pose delegate ls --active\",\npose-mcp/internal/cli/help_catalog.go-371-\t\t\t\"pose delegate resume my-feature-r1 --wait-until-reset\",\npose-mcp/internal/cli/help_catalog.go-372-\t\t\t\"pose delegate agents --json\",\npose-mcp/internal/cli/help_catalog.go-373-\t\t},\n--\npose-mcp/internal/cli/help_catalog.go-578-\t\t},\npose-mcp/internal/cli/help_catalog.go-579-\t\tExamples: []string{\npose-mcp/internal/cli/help_catalog.go-580-\t\t\t\"pose contribute enable\",\npose-mcp/internal/cli/help_catalog.go-581-\t\t\t\"pose contribute status\",\npose-mcp/internal/cli/help_catalog.go-582-\t\t\t\"pose contribute stage --title \\\"Missing Svelte 5 Rune check\\\" --type enhancement\",\npose-mcp/internal/cli/help_catalog.go-583-\t\t\t\"pose contribute list\",\npose-mcp/internal/cli/help_catalog.go-584-\t\t},\npose-mcp/internal/cli/help_catalog.go-585-\t},\npose-mcp/internal/cli/help_catalog.go:586:\t\"release\": {\npose-mcp/internal/cli/help_catalog.go:587:\t\tName:            \"release\",\npose-mcp/internal/cli/help_catalog.go:588:\t\tSummaryEN:       \"Governed release planning, freezing, verification, and publication\",\npose-mcp/internal/cli/help_catalog.go:589:\t\tSummaryPtBR:     \"Planejamento, congelamento, verificação e publicação governada de releases\",\npose-mcp/internal/cli/help_catalog.go:590:\t\tUsage:           \"pose release <plan|prepare|check|notes|record|status|open-next|backfill> --version vX.Y.Z\",\npose-mcp/internal/cli/help_catalog.go:591:\t\tDescriptionEN:   \"Orchestrates immutable release cycles, compiling changelog fragments, generating release notes, and validating delivery assurance.\",\npose-mcp/internal/cli/help_catalog.go:592:\t\tDescriptionPtBR: \"Orquestra ciclos imutáveis de release, compilando fragmentos de changelog, gerando notas de release e validando garantias de entrega.\",\npose-mcp/internal/cli/help_catalog.go-593-\t\tSubcommands: []SubcommandHelp{\npose-mcp/internal/cli/help_catalog.go:594:\t\t\t{\"plan\", \"pose release plan --version vX.Y.Z\", \"Preview the release cut, eligible specs, and changelog entries\", \"Visualiza o corte de release, specs elegíveis e itens do changelog\"},\npose-mcp/internal/cli/help_catalog.go:595:\t\t\t{\"prepare\", \"pose release prepare --version vX.Y.Z [--apply] [--allow-moved-claims]\", \"Freeze selected fragments into canonical release notes and manifest\", \"Congela fragmentos em notas canônicas de release e manifesto\"},\npose-mcp/internal/cli/help_catalog.go:596:\t\t\t{\"check\", \"pose release check --version vX.Y.Z\", \"Validate release readiness and delivery evidence completeness\", \"Valida prontidão da release e completude das evidê